    {
      "title": "CD4PE and SCM",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 96
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**PE's console is the shippable scope and the other two are separate questions.** The request that produced this board named three consoles. Only PE's has been checked.\n\n- **CD4PE** has its own auth store, and pdctng already talks to it for deployments, so an audit surface is plausible. Nobody has confirmed one exists or that it is reachable the same way.\n- **SCM** is a separate product whose audit surface has not been looked at, and which an estate may not run at all.\n\nPromising three consoles and finding that two need different mechanisms is how a documented path turns out to be about a machine nobody ran it against, so this board claims one."
      },
      "id": 997769511
    }
  ],
  "description": "Who signed in to PE, who minted a token, and who changed a role, a group or the SAML configuration. The landing place for audit activity (R342); the collection that fills it is not enabled yet."
